[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:A Good Idea]
[00:00.84]Lesson 109 | 第109课
[00:02.94]A good idea | 一个好主意
[00:05.56]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:11.14]What does Jane have with her coffee? | 简喝咖啡时会吃什么？
[00:15.88]Shall I make some coffee, Jane? | 简，我来煮些咖啡好吗？
[00:21.11]That's a good idea, Charlotte. | 好主意，夏洛特。
[00:25.08]It's ready. | 咖啡煮好了。
[00:27.60]Do you want any milk? | 你要加奶吗？
[00:30.54]Just a little, please. | 请加一点点。
[00:33.80]What about some sugar? | 加糖吗？
[00:37.11]Two teaspoonfuls? | 两小勺？
[00:40.06]No, less than that. | 不，少一点。
[00:43.52]One and a half teaspoonfuls, please. | 请加一勺半。
[00:47.79]That's enough for me. | 对我来说够了。
[00:51.11]That was very nice. | 真是太好了。
[00:54.90]Would you like some more? | 你还要再来点吗？
[00:57.46]Yes, please. | 是的，请。
[01:01.03]I'd like a cigarette, too. | 我也想抽支烟。
[01:04.38]May I have one? | 我可以来一支吗？
[01:07.46]Of course. | 当然。
[01:08.85]I think there are a few in that box. | 我想那个盒子里有几支。
[01:14.12]I'm afraid it's empty. | 恐怕是空的。
[01:17.83]What a pity! | 真可惜！
[01:20.08]It doesn't matter. | 没关系。
[01:22.71]Have a biscuit instead. | 那就吃块饼干吧。
[01:26.10]Eat more and smoke less! | 多吃少抽！
[01:29.72]That's very good advice! | 这是非常好的建议！